8e6dcb8a7a42294e878","event_uuid":"62f74d6e-55f1-43d6-b14b-2f50ab5722d7","position":{"commit_sha":"42a1348a2405887112ca0828767d65f24bd37fa5","position":"1788967874160012885-62f74d6e-55f1-43d6-b14b-2f50ab5722d7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Operator ruling 2026-09-08: Option 1 approved — add docker-storage-cap.sh and journald-cap.sh to both OBS_PATHS and MATERIALIZER_PATHS, and teach check_deploy_manifest.py to derive *-cap.sh scripts automatically so future cap scripts cannot be omitted. No new CAP_PATHS mechanism (mechanism-ratchet: prefer existing sets). Per ADR 0112 operator-settable caps must deploy when changed.","timestamp":1788910463322737001}],"created_at":1788563252907784641,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"db08ba84-ea88-469f-b78b-3cf1b9c50fa7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e956-b1c3-45b9-4016"},{"link_uuid":"83ba5f50-0970-4452-87d2-9bab46e6ae2c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e956-b1c3-45b9-4016"},{"link_uuid":"3818f262-4056-49a2-9138-79ebf77159cc","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8169-e788-8e9f-47fc"},{"link_uuid":"62f74d6e-55f1-43d6-b14b-2f50ab5722d7","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b9b6-702a-33a6-4c74"}],"description":"# Deploy manifests do not cover the host disk-cap scripts\n\n## Context\n\nOperator ruling 2026-09-08: Option 1 approved — add docker-storage-cap.sh and journald-cap.sh to both OBS_PATHS and MATERIALIZER_PATHS, and teach check_deploy_manifest.py to derive *-cap.sh scripts automatically so future cap scripts cannot be omitted. No new CAP_PATHS mechanism (mechanism-ratchet: prefer existing sets). Per ADR 0112 operator-settable caps must deploy when changed.\n\nPlan-review clarification: the derivation rule must be non-vacuous for every existing `infra/**/*-cap.sh` script. Current main has four host cap scripts:\n\n- `infra/scripts/docker-storage-cap.sh`\n- `infra/scripts/journald-cap.sh`\n- `infra/scripts/vartmp-cap.sh`\n- `infra/scripts/container-cap.sh`\n\nAll four are consumed by `infra/scripts/compose-up.sh --install` and by `infra/scripts/observability.sh` read/check paths. Therefore the implementation will cover all four in the existing `MATERIALIZER_PATHS` and `OBS_PATHS` manifests, rather than creating a new CAP_PATHS mechanism. The deploy-manifest checker will keep its existing union coverage check and add a derived per-manifest cap check: every derived `infra/**/*-cap.sh` path must be covered by both `MATERIALIZER_PATHS` and `OBS_PATHS` unless explicitly excluded with a reason.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` lists all existing `infra/scripts/*-cap.sh` scripts in `MATERIALIZER_PATHS`, because `compose-up.sh --install` consumes those installers.\n- [x] `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` lists all existing `infra/scripts/*-cap.sh` scripts in `OBS_PATHS`, because `observability.sh` reads/checks those cap sources.\n- [x] `scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py` derives `infra/**/*-cap.sh` automatically and verifies cap coverage against the existing consuming manifests (`MATERIALIZER_PATHS` and `OBS_PATHS`), with no new curated `CAP_PATHS` set.\n- [x] A regression test in `tests/unit/test_check_deploy_manifest.py` proves the derivation is non-vacuous: removing a cap script from either consuming manifest makes the deploy-manifest checker fail.\n- [x] Targeted verification passes: `checked: env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0 PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python -m pytest -q tests/unit/test_check_deploy_manifest.py`.\n- [x] Final gate passes before push: `checked: env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0 PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2`.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Add cap scripts to existing consuming manifests."},{"path":"scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py","reason":"Derive infra/**/*-cap.sh automatically."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_deploy_manifest.py","reason":"Regression coverage for cap-script derivation and missing manifest entries."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","8169-e788-8e9f-47fc"],["relates_to","b9b6-702a-33a6-4c74"],["relates_to","e956-b1c3-45b9-4016"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"de740b84-5474-4c84-830b-185c18d66340","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["infra","disk-ceiling","autodeploy"],"ticket_id":"5246-2ec0-1fa6-4637","ticket_type":"task","title":"Deploy manifests do not cover the host disk-cap scripts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["83ba5f50-0970-4452-87d2-9bab46e6ae2c","1574e604-9ef1-457a-af5c-700d95fbc0cd","6f2e2a0b-3e35-429d-b909-421295027038","8e898b94-df3d-4f8c-8635-7ea1e4c8aa88","3e196586-6a87-499d-a97b-21f8b9d3008e","865d3b91-93b6-4b98-8c01-f94910ff4d12","de740b84-5474-4c84-830b-185c18d66340","c71967aa-77c9-42f3-b4a4-3b22a2f71b1f","00870390-c5a0-45ed-90f6-39541cf2b861","3818f262-4056-49a2-9138-79ebf77159cc","62f74d6e-55f1-43d6-b14b-2f50ab5722d7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788971663175035001,"uuid":"da15a93e-40f9-4add-91d2-200ad81c068b"}